/*
ACCESS KEY MODES

mixed
- User can use either the Global Key or their Personal Key.

personal
- User can only use their assigned Personal Key.
- Global Key will not work.

global
- User can only use the Global Key.
- Personal Keys will not work.

Examples:

Mode: mixed
  ✓ Global Key
  ✓ Personal Key

Mode: personal
  ✗ Global Key
  ✓ Personal Key

Mode: global
  ✓ Global Key
  ✗ Personal Key
*/
``


